      non-dict, permission-denied) stay byte-identical.
    - test_D5_plist_path_emission.py: module-level skip (D5.1
      /health probe + D5.2/D5.3 graphiti-comparison halves).
    - test_d2_workspace_state_scaffold.py: skip
      test_AC_D_2_1_mcp_json_lands_under_workspace_state +
